homelab-webtheme (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Shared web chrome for the homelab Mojolicious apps:
    the Homelab::WebTheme plugin plus homelab/{head,header,footer} partials.
    The header carries the Silver Linings logo and the account dropdown,
    using the .profile/.avatar/.menu vocabulary accountmanage and drive had
    already converged on independently, so adopting it is a style swap rather
    than a markup rewrite. Everything the partials need is exposed as a
    HELPER rather than a stash value, so a partial can never be read before
    it is populated and can never explode on a page that did not think about
    it (drive's login page is exactly that case).

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:10:00 -0500
